-# Task contract — researched line-ups, batch 3: MLS
+# Task contract — researched line-ups, batch 4: Argentina's Liga Profesional
 
 objective: >
-  fixture_lineup_corrections gains the researched line-ups of the MLS matches of the 2025 and 2026
-  seasons on the research list: both team sheets of each match, every player with the provider's
-  id, starter or bench, the minutes on and off and whom each substitute replaced, from the league's
-  official match data shown on the mlssoccer.com line-up and match feed pages. A match the official
-  data cannot complete stays out and is listed in the MR.
+  fixture_lineup_corrections gains the researched line-ups of the Liga Profesional matches of the
+  2026 season on the research list: both team sheets of each match, every player with the
+  provider's id, starter or bench, the minutes on and off and whom each substitute replaced, from
+  the league's official match sheet on ligaprofesional.ar. A match the official sheet cannot
+  complete stays out and is listed in the MR.
 
 refs: >
